  "solution": {
    "text": "Primary valency $=$ Oxidation state<br />Secondary valency $=$ Co-ordination number<br />$\\begin{array}{|l|l|c|c|}\\hline & Complex & \\begin{array}{l} \\text{Primary} \\\\ \\text{valency}\\end{array} & \\text{Secondary} \\\\\\hline (A) & {\\left[\\mathrm{Co}(\\mathrm{en})_2 \\mathrm{Cl}_2\\right] \\mathrm{Cl}} & 3 & 6 \\\\\\hline (B) & {\\left[\\mathrm{Pt}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_2 \\mathrm{Cl}\\left(\\mathrm{NO}_2\\right)\\right]} & 2 & 4 \\\\\\hline (C) & \\mathrm{Hg}\\left[\\mathrm{Co}(\\mathrm{SCN})_4\\right] & 3 & 4 \\\\\\hline (D) & {[\\mathrm{Mg}(\\mathrm{EDTA})]^{2-}} & 2 & 6 \\\\\\hline\\end{array}$",
    "image": null
